(slower-hummingbird-sv05-rate-lqr-hover-6dof)
*title Hummingbird scaled-LQR rate-loop hover witness
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle aero-load-mode=direct-wrench aero-wrench-frame=source-z-up rotor-allocation=quad-x rotor-arm-m=0.17 rotor-thrust-coefficient=5.57e-6 rotor-reaction-torque-coefficient=1.36e-7 rotor-speed-min=0 rotor-speed-max=1500 reference-area=1.0 reference-length=0.34 dry-mass-kg=0.5 inertia-x=0.00365 inertia-y=0.00368 inertia-z=0.00703 envelope-max-speed=10
*runtime status actuator allocator=hummingbird-quad-x maximum-moment=1 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=720
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*runtime lqr rate states=wx,wy,wz controls=moment-x,moment-y,moment-z q-rate=0.0004 r-moment=1.0 state-rate-scale-rad-s=1.0 control-moment-scale-nm=1.0 method=continuous update=initial
*runtime control rotor-speed vehicle=1 default=469.124102661955 lower=0 upper=1500
*trajectory 1 hummingbird start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6378139.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=0.0 zdt=0.0 qw=0.5 qx=-0.5 qy=-0.5 qz=0.5 wx=0.4 wy=-0.3 wz=0.2 time=0.0 mass=0.5 propellant_mass=0.0
  *segment 1 rate-lqr-hover
    *integ dtprnt=0.02 dt=0.001
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *when time>0.5 stop
*end
